                <li>Post a photo, price and radius in under 30 seconds</li>
                <li>Browse what's within walking distance, map or list</li>
                <li>Claim with one tap on “I want this”</li>
                <li>Trust signals: tenure, account age, distance</li>
                <li>Out: messaging, payments, delivery, other neighborhoods</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="source">Source: /strategize proposed MVP scope.</p>
