    <div class="deck-ex">
      <p class="deck-ex-plate">10 / 13</p>
      <div class="deck-frame">
          <section class="layout-claim-visual">
            <div class="slide">
              <h2>Each launch blocker has a designed fix, and none has been re-evaluated</h2>
              <div class="visual" role="img" aria-label="Table pairing each launch blocker with its designed fix: empty new neighborhoods get a seeding strategy, missing onboarding gets a first-run flow, and the map's exclusion of screen reader users is fixed by making list view an equal default.">
                <table class="deck-table">
                  <thead><tr><th>Blocker</th><th>Designed fix</th><th>From</th></tr></thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td class="strong">New neighborhoods start empty</td><td>Contact import, imported Buy Nothing listings, a featured first post, the nearest active neighborhood as fallback</td><td>/fortify</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="strong">No onboarding</td><td>Three-screen first run, then the map with the closest items highlighted</td><td>/fortify</td></tr>
                    <tr><td class="strong">Map shuts out screen readers</td><td>List view as an equal, and the default when VoiceOver or TalkBack is on</td><td>/include</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <p class="source">Source: /evaluate E-01 to E-03; /fortify first run and cold start; /include.</p>
            </div>
          </section>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="deck-ex">
