              <ul>
                <li>Build: MVP scope plus first run, seeding and list view</li>
                <li>Alongside: run the 13 interviews, re-evaluate before launch</li>
                <li>Decide: quick-reply coordination in the MVP or v2</li>
                <li>[NEEDS EVIDENCE: engineering estimate, team, launch date]</li>
