  <figure class="deck-notes">
    <figcaption class="deck-ex-plate">Speaker notes · slide 10</figcaption>
    <blockquote>
      <p>Cold start is the existential one: a neighborhood with no listings never activates. Every blocker now has a designed fix, but the evaluation hasn't been re-run against them. That re-run belongs before launch, not before the build starts.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </figure>
